#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Bulk Catalogue Manager for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://github.com/wadejbeckett/bulk-catalogue-manager-for-woocommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Manage many WooCommerce products at once from one simple screen. Every bulk change is previewed first, recorded and reversible."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Wade Beckett"
msgstr ""

msgid "Something went wrong while changing this category, so it may not have been finished. Reload the categories to check it."
msgstr ""

